@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<h1>Privacy</h1>
<div class="prose-card">
    <p>BugTracker keeps the account, company, project, and ticket information you enter so a team can follow the work. Passwords are stored by ASP.NET Identity. Profile images and ticket files are saved with the record they belong to.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">This application does not sell that information. Sign out on a shared computer when you are done.</p>
</div>
